!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Magnesium atom. Spin-orbit fockspace test calculations.                                             
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.INTFLG                                                                                             
1 1 0                                                                                               
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.RELCCSD                                                                                            
