*SCF                                                                                                
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-10 1.0E-7                                                                                      
.CNVINT                                                                                             
0.01 0.0001                                                                                         
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
4 6                                                                                                 
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0                                                                           
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0                                                                           
**RELCC                                                                                             
.FOCKSP                                                                                             
#.ENERGY                                                                                            
.PRINT                                                                                              
1                                                                                                   
#.DEBUG                                                                                             
*CCENER                                                                                             
